                <p>After “<ref href="#sec-501">section 501</ref>”, insert “or a decision under subsection 501CA(4) not to revoke a decision to cancel a visa”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-17">
